{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37506","headline":"福州开元寺塔 · 周朴","name":"福州开元寺塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开元寺里七重塔，遥对方山影拟齐。\n杂俗人看离世界，孤高僧上觉天低。\n唯堪片片紫霞映，不与蒙蒙白雾迷。\n心若无私罗汉在，参差免向日虹西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周朴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}